WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.311 --> 00:00:03.203
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.304
How is it everybody doing
tonight?

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.638
That sounds good.
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.973
President Biden traveled to
Camp David this weekend

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:09.875
on an extended August vacation.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.244
Luckily he managed to
get out of there right before

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:14.080
the Taliban took it over.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.316
The Taliban yesterday entered
the city of Kabul and took

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.919
control of Afghanistan's
presidential palace.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.887
Most Americans watched in horror

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:24.891
while some Americans
watched for tips.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:28.094
The Taliban has officially
declared victory in Afghanistan

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.396
nearly 20 years
after the U.S. invasion.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:35.367
Though it was just rude
to use the banner.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:38.804
In a new interview, Secretary
of State Tony Blinken discussed

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:41.474
the Taliban's rapid takeover
of Afghanistan,

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:44.911
but not before trying
every other possible topic.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:49.048
"So, who's watching
'White Lotus?'"

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.451
President Biden has announced
plans to send

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.720
more than 5,000 troops
to Afghanistan

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.322
as U.S. forces continue their
withdrawal from the country.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.857
Though I'm not sure
it makes sense to send people

00:00:58.857 --> 00:01:02.161
to a country to get people
out of that country.

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:04.497
You know what it's like.
You ever try to leave a bar

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.599
with your friends,
and you're all outside

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.934
and one guy is still inside,
talking to somebody.

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:11.103
So your friend goes in
to get that person

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.639
and then they don't come out.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:16.675
And before you know it, you're
there for another 20 years.

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:18.378
It's like that.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.813
Former President Trump released
a statement on Friday

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:23.449
amid the deteriorating situation
in Afghanistan,

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:27.020
and, yeah, he's enjoying this.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.855
Supreme Court Justice
Stephen Breyer

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.756
turned 83 years old yesterday.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:33.526
Seven of the other justices
wished him a happy birthday

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:36.795
with Clarence Thomas
writing the dissent.

00:01:36.795 --> 00:01:40.199
New Jersey Governor Phil Murphy
is facing criticism

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:42.035
for taking a vacation to Italy

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.704
amidst a spike
in coronavirus cases.

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:48.040
He knows he can get that food
in Jersey, right?

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.944
Their state flag is
sausage and peppers.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:54.147
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:57.650
Today was director
James Cameron's 67th birthday.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.086
And he celebrated the same way
he does every year,

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.355
by not releasing "Avatar 2."

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.623
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.292
The fast-food chain Wendy's
announced last week

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.529
that it will open 700 so-called
ghost kitchens

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.897
that only prepare food
for delivery orders,

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:14.700
and it will not include
a dining room for customers.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.503
And in case you've never seen
a Wendy's dining room,

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:19.105
here's what it looks like.

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.641
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.642
And finally,
authorities in New York

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:27.046
are looking to question a couple
after an MTA train operator

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:31.117
allegedly let his girlfriend
drive the D train last week

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:32.985
through multiple subway stops,

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:35.088
and she was so bad at it

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:37.824
that none of the passengers
noticed.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.925
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:39.926
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

